<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and</p>
<p>gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 higher than Monday's close. Top</p>
<p>$54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    52.50-54.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    51.50-52.50</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    50.50-51.50</p>
<p>    Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $55.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    52.00-55.00</p>
</text>
